{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Testimonials",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "What Our Customers Have to Say"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Testimonials" }]
}
{% endschema %}

<section class="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2>{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonial-grid">
      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-card__quote-mark">&ldquo;</div>
        <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-card__text">I highly recommend this cognitive tool program for brain rehab and concussion recovery! This kit comes totally equipped with everything you need to rehab your brain at home. With a variety of activities including a comprehensive workbook, games, hands-on tools, and tracking sheets, you will improve six areas with specific activities that target multiple parts of the brain each day.</p>
        <div class="testimonial-card__author">
          <img src="{{ 'avatar-1.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Bonnie" class="testimonial-card__avatar-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
          <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="display:none">B</div>
          <div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__name">Bonnie</div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__role">Recent Customer</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-card__quote-mark">&ldquo;</div>
        <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-card__text">I loved the Cognitive FX program and found that it helped me immensely; however, I found it hard to continue doing once I returned home because the exercises I had were limited to only a few and I didn't have the resources I once had access to in the program.</p>
        <div class="testimonial-card__author">
          <img src="{{ 'testimonial-1.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Tiffany B." class="testimonial-card__avatar-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
          <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="display:none">T</div>
          <div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__name">Tiffany B.</div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__role">Recent Customer</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-card__quote-mark">&ldquo;</div>
        <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-card__text">This therapy tool provides so many at-home exercises that are easy to set up and understand. It provided me with the resources to continue my therapy at home.</p>
        <div class="testimonial-card__author">
          <img src="{{ 'avatar-2.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Aiden L." class="testimonial-card__avatar-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
          <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="display:none">A</div>
          <div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__name">Aiden L.</div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__role">Recent Reviewer</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-card__quote-mark">&ldquo;</div>
        <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-card__text">I loved how organized it was, and liked the quantity and variety of cards and exercises it came with. It provided me with help in the six areas I needed. I look forward to using this program throughout my life to continue helping my brain function at its best.</p>
        <div class="testimonial-card__author">
          <img src="{{ 'screen-shot.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Jordan D." class="testimonial-card__avatar-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
          <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="display:none">J</div>
          <div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__name">Jordan D.</div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__role">Recent Reviewer</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-card__quote-mark">&ldquo;</div>
        <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-card__text">I've had the opportunity to use the cognitive efficiency tool, and I must say I'm thoroughly impressed. This all-in-one solution effectively targets various aspects of cognitive function, from word recall and memory to logic and attention. The inclusion of balance, motor, and vision exercises adds a unique dimension from your standard online cognitive tool.</p>
        <div class="testimonial-card__author">
          <img src="{{ 'testimonial-2.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="David" class="testimonial-card__avatar-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
          <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="display:none">D</div>
          <div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__name">David</div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__role">Customer</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card">
        <div class="testimonial-card__quote-mark">&ldquo;</div>
        <div class="testimonial-card__stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-card__text">It's like doing a fun workout where you don't realize you are working hard because you are enjoying it so much. I even played some of the games with my grandchildren and they enjoyed them as well. The entire program gives you well balanced, all-around tools to rehab and assist in your post concussion recovery.</p>
        <div class="testimonial-card__author">
          <img src="{{ 'avatar-1.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Bonnie" class="testimonial-card__avatar-img" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'">
          <div class="testimonial-card__avatar" style="display:none">B</div>
          <div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__name">Bonnie</div>
            <div class="testimonial-card__role">Verified Purchase</div>
          </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
